Sun Nov 15 00:30:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Add classic-colors-save-prompt.patch: track whether the image was
  modified and, on File > Exit or when the window is closed, ask
  "Do you want to save changes?" (Save / Don't Save / Cancel); Save
  places a pending text box or selection first and uses Save As for
  untitled images
- Add classic-colors-text-box-click.patch: a plain click with the
  text tool no longer creates a tiny box whose text is invisible;
  boxes smaller than one line at the current font size are enlarged

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Sat Nov 14 23:30:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Initial package of classic-colors 1.1.1
  * Help menu opens the HTML manual from %{_datadir} instead of
    the hardcoded /usr/local path
  * About dialog shows the package version instead of v1.0.1
  * Add classic-colors-gcc14.patch: fix incompatible pointer types
    that GCC 14+ rejects; the save error dialog now frees its
    XmString with XmStringFree instead of XtFree
  * Add desktop file and hicolor icon
